{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"共尾函子"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"共尾函子"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>共尾函子</strong> (cofinal functor) 又叫<strong>终函子</strong> (final functor), 是不改变"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":"的指标代换, 即对于共尾函子 $f\\colon I\\to J$ 以及图表 $X\\colon J\\to \\mathcal C$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_{i\\in I}X_{f(i)}\\to \\operatorname{colim}_{j\\in J}X_j\r\n$$\n为等价.</p>\n<p><strong>关于英文名称的注</strong>. Cofinal functor 的前缀 co- 是 “<strong>共</strong>” (来自拉丁文 cum) 而非 “余” (来自拉丁文 contra) 的意思.</p>\n<p>对偶的概念是"},{"Local":{"url":"共首函子","text":"共首函子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>命题-定义</strong>. 对于函子 $f\\colon I\\to J$, 若下列等价条件成立, 则称之为<strong>共尾函子</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对任意 (有余极限的) 图表 $X\\colon J\\to \\mathcal C$, 比较映射 $\\operatorname{colim}_{i\\in I}X_{f(i)}\\to \\operatorname{colim}_{j\\in J}X_j$ 为等价;</li>\n<li>同上一个条件, 但只要求 $\\mathcal C$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 的情形;</li>\n<li>对任意图表 $X\\colon J\\to \\mathcal C$ 以及 $c\\in\\mathcal C$, 比较映射 $\\operatorname{Hom}(X,\\operatorname{const}_J c)\\to \\operatorname{Hom}(Xf,\\operatorname{const}_I c)$ 为等价;</li>\n<li>对任意 $j\\in J$, 范畴 $(j\\downarrow f):=\\{(i,u\\colon j\\to f(i))\\}$ "},{"Local":{"url":"弱可缩范畴","text":"弱可缩"}},{"Plain":" (即底层"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"是"},{"Local":{"url":"可缩(同伦类型论)","text":"可缩"}},{"Plain":"的).</li>\n<li>对任意 $j\\in J$,\n$$\r\n  \\int_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_J(j,f(i)) = *.\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心观察是由于"},{"Local":{"url":"余端","text":"余端"}},{"Plain":"的 Fubini 定理,\n$$\r\n    \\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{colim}_{i\\in I}X_{f(i)}\r\n    &amp;=\\int_{i\\in I}X_{f(i)}\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\\int_{i\\in I}\\int_{j\\in J}\\operatorname{Hom}_{J}(j,f(i))\\times X_j\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\\int_{j\\in J}\\Big(\\int_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_{J}(j,f(i))\\Big)\\times X_j.\r\n    \\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>另外, 范畴 $(j \\downarrow f)$ 的底层"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" (把所有态射取逆得到的 $\\infty$-群胚) 正是 $\\int_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_{J}(j,f(i))$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>伴随</h3>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 右"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":"是共尾函子. 或者说有左伴随的函子是共尾函子.</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>. 设函子 $f\\colon I\\to J$ 有左伴随 $l$, 则\n$$\r\n(j\\downarrow f) = \\{(i,u\\colon j\\to f(i))\\} = \\{i,l(j)\\to i\\} = I_{l(j)/}\r\n$$\n有始对象, 当然可缩; 另一种看法是\n$$\r\n\\int_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_J(j,f(i)) = \\int_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_I(l(j),i)=*.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}